Rule 25 (Negative indices are allowed only if the tensor has at least one dimension)
{v_1: tensor, v_2: tuple(int)} |= if ∃i ∈ [0, shape(v_2, ".len") - 1] : v_2[i] < 0 then ndim(v_1) > 0
