Rule 33 (The input tensor and dims tuple should both have non-zero number of elements.)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tuple(int)} |= (∃i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1)-1]: shape(v_1, i) > 0) ∧ (shape(v_2, ".len") > 0)
